#: src/Rules/RuleCatalog.php:217
msgid "Provide discernible text inside the heading, or remove the empty heading element."
msgstr ""

#: src/Rules/RuleCatalog.php:224
msgid "Do not skip heading levels. Use a logical, sequential heading hierarchy."
msgstr ""

#: src/Rules/RuleCatalog.php:231
msgid "Add a single descriptive <h1> that identifies the main content of the page."
msgstr ""

